{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/3544c8bcf60d8e6129983895413d6fa1.webp?t=1773050078\" width=600 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An abandoned school at midnight... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players split into two roles: &quot;Hiders&quot; and &quot;Oni (Seeker),&quot; facing off in fast-paced, three-minute rounds. Your only lifeline is the flashlight in your hand. Read the light and shadows, listen for every sound and presence\u2014hold your breath, run, and escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is no ordinary game of KAKUREONI -a deadly game of hide-and-seek. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something inhuman lurks in the darkness\u2014 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a third presence that will never side with the living. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of children, spirited away into the night, struggling to find their way back home to their families. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/97ad424eb857b569411daad17cda8d27.webp?t=1773050078\" width=1560 height=24 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/43d9483fb455ff77939586000f1db484.webp?t=1773050078\" width=600 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c63-Minute High-Speed Rounds \u2013 Tense, replayable matches you can experience again and again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Asymmetrical Multiplayer Horror \u2013 Two sides with different roles: Hiders and Oni (Seeker), each with unique thrills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Light and Sound Mind Games \u2013 Your flashlight, footsteps, and even breathing can reveal your location. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Walkie-Talkie Communication \u2013 Only humans can use walkie-talkies to talk at any time\u2014but if an Oni is nearby\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6A Third Threat \u2013 An otherworldly being roams the map, blending predictable patterns with randomness to constantly disrupt the game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Thrilling Even After Capture \u2013  Even after you\u2019re caught, you can still enjoy spectating alongside other captured players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Coordinate with Your Team Using Walkie-Talkies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/a339947a3ff3acdbf03d5e296da7470f.poster.avif?t=1773050078\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/a339947a3ff3acdbf03d5e296da7470f.webm?t=1773050078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/a339947a3ff3acdbf03d5e296da7470f.mp4?t=1773050078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Kakure Oni</strong>, human players can talk to each other using walkie-talkies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cOver here!\u201d \u201cWatch out!\u201d \u2014 calling out to your teammates and moving in sync is the key to escaping safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>But be careful\u2026</strong></i> <i><strong>using a walkie-talkie while an Oni is nearby might let it hear your conversation.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buy Mysterious Dagashi Snacks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/c85b3999f8c69107e5c1cbcd8152f91f.poster.avif?t=1773050078\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/c85b3999f8c69107e5c1cbcd8152f91f.webm?t=1773050078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/c85b3999f8c69107e5c1cbcd8152f91f.mp4?t=1773050078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the game begins, human players can spend their allowance to buy <strong>dagashi</strong> snacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dagashi sold by the old lady are packed with strange and mysterious effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them at the right moment, and you can turn the tide of the match in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ghosts That Lurk in the School</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/c5040fbd4f2d25b387f986621a2eeab6.poster.avif?t=1773050078\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/c5040fbd4f2d25b387f986621a2eeab6.webm?t=1773050078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/c5040fbd4f2d25b387f986621a2eeab6.mp4?t=1773050078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The school is haunted not only by humans and Oni \u2014 but by countless ghosts as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These ghosts side with the Oni and hinder the humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans can detect ghosts using <strong>Spirit Sight</strong>, but Oni can see them at all times, making things far from simple.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3988220?t=1773050078","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3988220?t=1773050078","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/4afd28cf0b9961a65aea8acfbe7613049e70cb42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773050078","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/4afd28cf0b9961a65aea8acfbe7613049e70cb42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773050078","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/3544c8bcf60d8e6129983895413d6fa1.webp?t=1773050078\" width=600 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An abandoned school at midnight... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players split into two roles: &quot;Hiders&quot; and &quot;Oni (Seeker),&quot; facing off in fast-paced, three-minute rounds. Your only lifeline is the flashlight in your hand. Read the light and shadows, listen for every sound and presence\u2014hold your breath, run, and escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is no ordinary game of KAKUREONI -a deadly game of hide-and-seek. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something inhuman lurks in the darkness\u2014 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a third presence that will never side with the living. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of children, spirited away into the night, struggling to find their way back home to their families. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/97ad424eb857b569411daad17cda8d27.webp?t=1773050078\" width=1560 height=24 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/43d9483fb455ff77939586000f1db484.webp?t=1773050078\" width=600 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c63-Minute High-Speed Rounds \u2013 Tense, replayable matches you can experience again and again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Asymmetrical Multiplayer Horror \u2013 Two sides with different roles: Hiders and Oni (Seeker), each with unique thrills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Light and Sound Mind Games \u2013 Your flashlight, footsteps, and even breathing can reveal your location. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Walkie-Talkie Communication \u2013 Only humans can use walkie-talkies to talk at any time\u2014but if an Oni is nearby\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6A Third Threat \u2013 An otherworldly being roams the map, blending predictable patterns with randomness to constantly disrupt the game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Thrilling Even After Capture \u2013  Even after you\u2019re caught, you can still enjoy spectating alongside other captured players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Coordinate with Your Team Using Walkie-Talkies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/a339947a3ff3acdbf03d5e296da7470f.poster.avif?t=1773050078\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/a339947a3ff3acdbf03d5e296da7470f.webm?t=1773050078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/a339947a3ff3acdbf03d5e296da7470f.mp4?t=1773050078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Kakure Oni</strong>, human players can talk to each other using walkie-talkies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cOver here!\u201d \u201cWatch out!\u201d \u2014 calling out to your teammates and moving in sync is the key to escaping safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>But be careful\u2026</strong></i> <i><strong>using a walkie-talkie while an Oni is nearby might let it hear your conversation.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buy Mysterious Dagashi Snacks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/c85b3999f8c69107e5c1cbcd8152f91f.poster.avif?t=1773050078\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/c85b3999f8c69107e5c1cbcd8152f91f.webm?t=1773050078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/c85b3999f8c69107e5c1cbcd8152f91f.mp4?t=1773050078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the game begins, human players can spend their allowance to buy <strong>dagashi</strong> snacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dagashi sold by the old lady are packed with strange and mysterious effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them at the right moment, and you can turn the tide of the match in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ghosts That Lurk in the School</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/c5040fbd4f2d25b387f986621a2eeab6.poster.avif?t=1773050078\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/c5040fbd4f2d25b387f986621a2eeab6.webm?t=1773050078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/c5040fbd4f2d25b387f986621a2eeab6.mp4?t=1773050078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The school is haunted not only by humans and Oni \u2014 but by countless ghosts as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These ghosts side with the Oni and hinder the humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans can detect ghosts using <strong>Spirit Sight</strong>, but Oni can see them at all times, making things far from simple.</p>","developers":["FORCES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/0a1906d2594d85e481e11abdedb2ee67b6155481/header.jpg?t=1773050078","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3988220/1512758257/58b4e6c82d5035c8de6570b26ff1ad6fafe9229b/1770702491/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770703079","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3988220/1512758257/58b4e6c82d5035c8de6570b26ff1ad6fafe9229b/1770702491/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770703079","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3988220/1512758257/58b4e6c82d5035c8de6570b26ff1ad6fafe9229b/1770702491/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770703079","id":257283373,"name":"\u304b\u304f\u308c\u9b3c_Teaser01","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257283373/b4096279cedad6c28e47b3064f33ade125950846/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770703079"}],"name":"\u304b\u304f\u308c\u9b3c","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> </li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["FORCES"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/b1abbce3d033c8a1fdc71924ee662cfc70d6bed3/ss_b1abbce3d033c8a1fdc71924ee662cfc70d6bed3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773050078","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/b1abbce3d033c8a1fdc71924ee662cfc70d6bed3/ss_b1abbce3d033c8a1fdc71924ee662cfc70d6bed3.600x338.jpg?t=1773050078"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/4ecb9ff2b9d25589ee18f2ea617f34b419b685f9/ss_4ecb9ff2b9d25589ee18f2ea617f34b419b685f9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773050078","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/4ecb9ff2b9d25589ee18f2ea617f34b419b685f9/ss_4ecb9ff2b9d25589ee18f2ea617f34b419b685f9.600x338.jpg?t=1773050078"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/ff3c16283520349cf537298eebd6afcddf98691d/ss_ff3c16283520349cf537298eebd6afcddf98691d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773050078","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/ff3c16283520349cf537298eebd6afcddf98691d/ss_ff3c16283520349cf537298eebd6afcddf98691d.600x338.jpg?t=1773050078"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/a364110e826371b274b8844cc7fe5bbc9f8b03ca/ss_a364110e826371b274b8844cc7fe5bbc9f8b03ca.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773050078","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/a364110e826371b274b8844cc7fe5bbc9f8b03ca/ss_a364110e826371b274b8844cc7fe5bbc9f8b03ca.600x338.jpg?t=1773050078"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/421403a3d16f58704515251afec69bba33702a3e/ss_421403a3d16f58704515251afec69bba33702a3e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773050078","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/421403a3d16f58704515251afec69bba33702a3e/ss_421403a3d16f58704515251afec69bba33702a3e.600x338.jpg?t=1773050078"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/c38d69f678968cfa17a2ea16316cec861113364f/ss_c38d69f678968cfa17a2ea16316cec861113364f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773050078","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/c38d69f678968cfa17a2ea16316cec861113364f/ss_c38d69f678968cfa17a2ea16316cec861113364f.600x338.jpg?t=1773050078"}],"short_description":"This is an asymmetrical multiplayer horror game. Deep within pitch-black ruins, with only the beam of a flashlight to guide you, the children must play KAKUREONI -a deadly game of hide-and-seek- to bring an end to the ritual of reincarnation.","steam_appid":3988220,"support_info":{"email":"support@forces.co.jp","url":""},"supported_languages":"Japanese<strong>*</strong>, English<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}